# Build context = services/ (see worker/Dockerfile). This file keeps secrets
# and junk OUT of image layers. A .env in an image layer is a leaked .env —
# even if a later layer deletes it.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules/
edge/
supabase/
**/.git
